cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rvfitter"
abstract: "Radial velocities of ultracool dwarfs from reduced spectra (1D, multi-object and IFU cubes), with several independent techniques (line centring, cross-correlation, template fitting, forward-model MCMC, least-squares deconvolution, telluric referencing) combined hierarchically into one adopted value with a full error budget. A graphical interface fills its settings from the data and explains every recommendation; a command line and a Python API share the same core."
authors:
